TASKS

Generate the following sections.

==================================================
SECTION 1
PRODUCT ATTRIBUTES
==================================================

Generate EXACTLY 10 product attributes.

The attributes must help customers make buying decisions.

Only include high-converting attributes.

Prioritize:

• Product Type
• Suitable For
• Skin Type
• Active Ingredients
• Texture
• Key Benefits
• Formula
• Special Features
• Free From
• Daily Use

Do NOT generate unnecessary attributes like:

✘ Item Weight
✘ Product Dimensions
✘ Package Quantity
✘ Shelf Life
✘ Country of Origin
✘ Target Audience
✘ Generic Yes/No fields unless they increase conversions.

Each attribute value should contain only 2–8 words.

Keep them premium, clean, and easy to scan.

==================================================
SECTION 2
CONVERSION BULLET POINTS
==================================================

Write EXACTLY 5 bullet points.

Rules:

• Every bullet MUST be between 50 and 80 characters only.
• Never exceed 80 characters.
• One benefit per bullet.
• Start with the customer benefit.
• Easy to scan.
• Mobile friendly.
• Premium tone.
• Emotionally persuasive.
• No fluff.
• No keyword stuffing.
• No repeated benefits.
• No medical claims.

Examples:

✔ Helps reduce excess oil without drying skin.
✔ Gentle daily cleansing with rich micro-foam.
✔ Supports smoother-looking, refreshed skin.

==================================================
SECTION 3
FAQ
==================================================

Write EXACTLY 4 FAQs.

Choose only questions customers genuinely ask before purchasing.

Each answer must:

• Be only 15–35 words.
• Deliver maximum information using minimum words.
• Reduce buying hesitation.
• Sound natural.
• Sound trustworthy.
• No unnecessary explanation.
• No generic AI wording.
• No exaggerated claims.

==================================================
SECTION 4
CUSTOMER REVIEWS
==================================================

Generate between 16 and 25 realistic review drafts.

Each review must contain:

Name

Rating (4★ or 5★)

Title

Review

Rules:

• Every review must feel written by a different person.
• Use different writing styles.
• Different personalities.
• Different review lengths.
• Some first-time buyers.
• Some repeat buyers.
• Some skeptical buyers.
• Some mentioning packaging.
• Some mentioning texture.
• Some mentioning fragrance.
• Some mentioning value.
• Some mentioning delivery.
• Some comparing previous products.
• Some very short.
• Some medium.
• Some detailed.

Maximum review length:
35–90 words.

Never repeat sentence structures.

Never repeat the same phrases.

Never make every review perfect.

Reviews should sound authentic and human.

Do not generate obvious AI-written reviews.

